<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-BARCELONA OPEN THIRD ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BARCELONA OPEN THIRD ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the third round of</p>
<p>the Barcelona Open tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Marc Goellner (Germany), on walk</p>
<p>over because of retirement</p>
<p>4-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 7-5  4-6 6-1</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Alberto Martin (Spain) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) beat Fernando Vicente (Spain) 7-5 3-6 6-1</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Christian Ruud (Norway) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>9-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat 8-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 6-1.</p>
</text>
